# TreeSheets Copilot — Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# API keys are stored at runtime via electron-store (in ~/Library/Application Support/treesheets-copilot/config.json)
# and are never committed to git. This file is only for any build-time env vars you may add in future.

# Example (not currently required — keys are entered in the app UI):
# VITE_APP_VERSION=1.0.0
